--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/data/geo.json and src/data/hit.json are derived from the India state and
union territory boundaries published by the DataMeet India community:

    https://github.com/datameet/maps
    Licensed CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Required attribution, shown in the app on the map itself:

