3. PHOTOGRAPHS — individual licences, see src/data/photo-credits.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The 20 photographs in public/photos/ come from Wikimedia Commons and remain
under their own individual licences: CC0, public domain, CC BY 2.0, CC BY 4.0,
CC BY-SA 3.0 and CC BY-SA 4.0. 18 of the 20 require attribution.

Per-file artist, licence, licence URL, source page and ready-to-render
attribution are in src/data/photo-credits.json, and are displayed in the app
at #/credits.

NOT MODIFIED: each file is a thumbnail rendered by Wikimedia's own servers and
stored byte for byte as it was delivered. That is a change of format and size,
not of content, so none of these is an adaptation.

